00:56:00,000 --> 00:56:06,000
Biltmore Estate is a historic house museum and tourist
attraction in Asheville, North Carolina.

13
01:00:40,000 --> 01:00:46,000
The main residence is the Biltmore House (or Biltmore Mansion), a Châteauesque-style
mansion built for George Washington Vanderbilt II between 1889 and 1895.

14
01:05:20,000 --> 01:05:26,000
It is the largest privately owned house in the United States at 178,926 sq ft
(16,622.8 m2) of floor space and 135,280 sq ft (12,568 m2) of living area.

15
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
It is still owned by George Vanderbilt's descendants and remains one
of the most prominent examples of Gilded Age mansions.

